{"id":"wb-6-565","name":"莫氏庄园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"莫氏庄园","text":"莫氏庄园，位于中国浙江省平湖市当湖街道，原为清代莫放梅祖孙三代所居住的住宅。为晚清风格的古典式建筑。\n莫氏庄园占地4851平方米，建筑面积2636平方米，房屋达七十余间。多部电视剧在此取景。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E6%B0%8F%E5%BA%84%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":90844471,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90844471","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/86935f99053a7ab18d9843dc.jpg","title":"Mo's_Manor,_2021-06-12_15.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mo%27s_Manor,_2021-06-12_15.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/Mo%27s_Manor%2C_2021-06-12_15.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​平湖莫氏庄园","width":320,"height":214}}